#| "photograph 'Fish Eyes' effect.<p><b>Twirl</b>: spins the photograph to "
#| "produce a Twirl pattern.<p><b>Cylinder Hor.</b>: warps the photograph "
#| "around a horizontal cylinder.<p><b>Cylinder Vert.</b>: warps the "
#| "photograph around a vertical cylinder.<p><b>Cylinder H/V.</b>: warps the "
#| "photograph around 2 cylinders, vertical and horizontal.<p><b>Caricature</"
